{{> roleDefinition}}

You are tasked with generating a comprehensive topic cluster strategy based on a seed keyword.

## Seed Keyword: {{seedKeyword}}

## Your Task:
Analyze the seed keyword and generate a complete topic cluster with:
1. A pillar topic (main comprehensive content piece)
2. 8-15 supporting subtopics (cluster content pieces)
3. Search intent classification for each subtopic
4. Estimated search volume and difficulty scores
5. Suggested internal linking structure

## Requirements:
- The pillar topic should be broad enough to link naturally to all subtopics
- Subtopics should cover different angles, questions, and aspects of the main topic
- Include a mix of informational, commercial, and transactional intent keywords
- Estimate realistic search volumes (relative, not exact)
- Difficulty scores should be on a 0-100 scale

{{> jsonOutputInstruction}}

Respond with this JSON structure:
{
  "pillarTopic": "string — the main pillar page topic",
  "pillarDescription": "string — brief description of what the pillar page should cover",
  "subTopics": [
    {
      "keyword": "string — the subtopic keyword",
      "searchVolume": number,
      "difficulty": number,
      "intent": "informational | commercial | transactional | navigational",
      "suggestedTitle": "string — suggested H1/title for this page",
      "linkToFrom": "string — which other cluster page should link to this"
    }
  ],
  "overallVolume": number,
  "contentCalendar": [
    {
      "week": number,
      "keyword": "string",
      "priority": "high | medium | low"
    }
  ]
}
